                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "A Save that writes a rig with no recorded audio over a session that held some, as after a Clear all, goes through from every entry point (the Sessions face's Save, the Library, the shortcut). Saving a session's settings to loop live on is intended (owner, 2026-11-26)."
