                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "Undo puts the cleared takes back through the same whole-rig undo as the Clear all notice, the pedal and \u2318\u21e7C, then saves the session again with them. Each track keeps the clear as a Redo."
              }
            ],
