                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "The Undo is there only while the Clear all can still be undone. After a restart, a new take, tracks cleared one by one, or another session opened, the message has no Undo, and it ends once the Clear all can no longer be undone. No copy of the old save is kept on disk."
              }
